      "text": "Jesus took bread … and said, Take, eat; this is my body, Matt. 26:26 (Mark 14:22). first day of the week, they came unto the sepulchre, Mark 16:2. this do in remembrance of me, Luke 22:19 (1 Cor. 11:24). bread that I will give is my flesh, John 6:51. first day of the week, when the disciples came together to break bread, Acts 20:7. planted together in the likeness of his death, Rom. 6:5. Buried with him in baptism, wherein also ye are risen, Col. 2:12. offer up spiritual sacrifices, acceptable to God, 1 Pet. 2:5. I was in the Spirit on the Lord’s day, Rev. 1:10.",
